system "ByteBuffer with a saved position"
state
  position is an integer from 0 to 2
  mark_at is an integer from -1 to 2
initially
  position is 0
  mark_at is -1

action advance
  requires position < 2
  position becomes position + 1

action mark
  mark_at becomes position

action reset
  requires mark_at >= 0
  position becomes mark_at

action rewind
  position becomes 0
  mark_at becomes -1

scenario "Rewind discards the mark"
  mark
  advance
  rewind
  reject reset
